        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Baldor claps you on the shoulder.* Done! The wagons are yours to guard. Take the east road up over the pass -- and keep your blade loose, for they always hit us somewhere on the high ground. Wilrun the Quartermaster keeps the tally at the waystation on the far side. Off you go!"
          }
        }
